abstract: >-
  AetherHarness is the fourteenth candidate of the Aether family. It investigates
  whether the composition of existing Aether dimensions is sufficient to guarantee
  synchronization across responsibilities, or whether an architectural remainder
  remains outside current coverage. Current status: Boundary Investigation
  (Externally Reviewed — Recommendation (a)). Phase 0: NOT AUTHORIZED. Decision: (E) Undetermined.
